ask g: flows(save, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-03
=== expect
f: 950.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-07
g: refused: RUN-LIMIT seen and unseen over more than 20 000 choices
warning: WARN-UNREAD place unexplained is read by nothing
